244628.missionDescription:
CNH is a world-class equipment and services company that sustainably advances the noble work of agriculture and construction workers. The Company provides the strategic direction, R&D capabilities, and investments that enable the success of its core Brands. Around the world, CNH Industrial brands are the driving force behind construction and agriculture. The innovation and efficiency they bring to the noble work of farming and building helps other areas of the global economy to reach their full potential. The Sales Administration Specialist (SSA) is a resource operating within the Commercial Operations dep.. 
She/He represents the main connection between Dealers, Distributors, Commercial team as well as with other internal deps. (eg. demand planning, pricing, logistics, Capital/Trade Finance), having in charge the whole order management process from entry/collection up to invoicing and distribution. 
She/He is expected to gain full awareness of market trends, sales volumes and distribution peculiarity, addressing opportunities and risks in order to proactively contribute to the achievement of the sales target of the Region. 
The main responsibilities of SSA role are:
	Order collection - SSA supports the Dealers in their order entry activity and validates the orders received, assessing possible match with company stock rather then addressing their production request to the plant, so as to optimize expected lead time and company stock management
	Order portfolio management – SSA manages order portfolio up to invoicing, promoting opportunities, assessing credit/manufacturing/logistics risks and proactively advising possible alternatives to offset/mitigate them, participating actively to the sales target achievement;
	Invoicing Management – SSA follows up invoicing process, assessing Dealer solvibility/credit release and deploying terms and conditions (prices, discounts, incoterms) in line with commercial policy and revenue recognition; 
	Transport supervision – SSA transmits instructions to set up and organize units transportation (outbound call-off) and supports document collection/preparation for customs clearance. She/He also follows up urgent transport needs, coordinating requests from Dealers and internal departments (eg. logistics, marketing) for units to be shipped to customers, trade fairs, open days, demos within mandatory deadlines; 
	Training activities & events - SSA provides training activities referred to the main sales platforms/tools. She/He also takes part to B2B initiatives (events, fairs, meetings, etc.) upon request.

245582.missionDescription:
Since 2015, papernest has been transforming the way people manage their contracts, making subscription, management, and switching simple through one smart, intuitive platform.

We have supported more than 2 million customers across France, Spain, and Italy. Along the way, we have continued to invest in new verticals, establishing papernest as a high-performing, innovative, and competitive scale-up in a fast-growing market. With over 900 employees, we are strengthening our position as a European market leader.

Within the Paid Acquisition team (Marketing & Sales team department) and based in Barcelona, your mission is to drive, plan and execute SEA Strategy for the Spanish market. 
Your role consists in generating leads of users that may be need one of the contracts we manage at papernest to our Operations/Product teams. You own accounts that drive between 60 to 70% of users for each country.  This is a strategic role for papernest since you will be managing one of our main acquisition channels for foreign countries. Your role will cover several areas : digital marketing, project management, SEA, data analysis and management.

Your futures missions :
1. Become the search leader of the Spanish markets :
• Monitor Spanish accounts with a data-driven (ROI-based) approach ;
• Test new campaigns, features and bidding strategy to increase our conversion rate and make sure we keep on growing ;
• Identify, prioritize and launch new test to boost our growth on these markets.


2. User experiences : own the whole SEA funnel for your accounts
• Ensure perfect content creation, integration and tracking of our landing pages  ;
• Promote a test & learn dynamic to better know our users and understand their behavior ;
• Benchmark our competitors and others sectors to find the best practices.


3. Analyze : you will be responsible of the profitability and KPIs of the accounts
• Analyze daily and weekly performances (profitability, deepd-ive analysis of the account, actions, recommendations etc.) ;
• Deep-dive on our campaigns performances and the new launched tests (auctions insights, benchmark, ROI, comparison, etc.).

245582.missionProfile:
About you :
Fluent in French and English, Spanish is a plus ; 
Business or engineering school ;
A first experience in the Digital Marketing field or in Consulting, previous experience in SEO/PPC is a plus ;
Strong analytical skills: you master Excel, SQL is a plus ;
Strong sense of ownership ;
Great interpersonal skills and great ability to communicate.

What We Offer :
Evolving in an international and inclusive environment: Everyone has their place at Papernest, and with over 46 different nationalities, it’s not uncommon for us to start a sentence in French and finish it in English or Spanish!
Compensation & Partnerships: A monthly allowance defined by Business France, check for the amount in Spain, which is updated every quarter.
Health & Transport: A health insurance plan, April, for hassle-free management of your healthcare expenses, with 100% reimbursement. To make your transition easier, we also cover 100% of your round-trip transportation costs.
Luggage: No decision to make! Papernest covers 100% of your luggage fees (up to 150kg) so you can enjoy all the seasons in Barcelona.
Career Development: For us, the VIE contract is a real stepping stone into professional life. We support your career ambitions by ensuring your learning and professional development throughout your experience with us.
Home office: Enjoy 2 days of home office per week to optimize your focus and efficiency.

